   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Training is paid once per checkpoint, but every model generation pays it again, and RL post-training is a large repeated cost.\nInference is the bill that grows with usage. During decode it is memory-bandwidth bound, not compute bound (see 7).",
